31
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:28,560
Identity though which is what we're going to be talking about today is is how to change your identity around this.
不过，身份认同才是今天要讨论的：如何改变你在这方面对自己的看法。

32
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:33,560
